Main,           Input
                Store   Main_Input

                Load    Main_Input
                Store   Sym_Input
                JnS     Sym
                Load    Sym_Output
                Store   Main_Output

                Load    Main_Output
                Output

                Halt

Main_Input,     Dec 0
Main_Output,    Dec 0

/////////////////////////////////////
Sym,            Hex 0
                Clear
                Subt Sym_Input
                Store Sym_Output
                JumpI Sym

Sym_Input,      Dec 0
Sym_Output,     Dec 0
